loads/origins/2ab35651-fb06-4da8-8e9a-61872afb26f8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=be12ba74aae13403d42775dd99b07ced 3x"}, "body": "Hi there! Your artwork looks so amazing!! I saw this posts and others and was absolutely charmed with your talent and style!\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@MELUNACANTUS/works/2\n\nI would be honored if you accepted an art request for my OC, Xivern! He is a guildmaster to a large fantasy adventuring guild! He is a fun loving, tactical leader who is confident in his abilities during combat and skilling in fighting. But also greets everyone he meets with a big, warm smile and not being afraid to be silly and have a good time.\n\nA background isn't necessary but would I be able to get a transparent background version as well? I plan to use this art within my social community and twitch/Youtube content. All proper credit will be attributed if used.\n\nI love the way you do gestures and would love to see him in a combat pose. Maybe using his sword? But I want to leave everything up to you for pose, expression, and clothing condition! Thank you so much for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1c7dcgJPCzZewhUVhsTD5T7LHLtkfrxbk?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@MELUNACANTUS/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2877632, "client_id": 2977811, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9acc54ae/uploads/origins/e96b7a55-2a74-43e2-8109-3b35f30958b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=694766795e17eaab36a556257c1802f2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9acc54ae/uploads/origins/e96b7a55-2a74-43e2-8109-3b35f30958b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=694766795e17eaab36a556257c1802f2, https://si.imgix.net/9acc54ae/uploads/origins/e9